    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="baa2de6d-4da0-5acb-a094-b9360f0e5b2a" activityNameId="e53d144e-b694-59a0-839a-a60413f3376d" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Alkylbenzene, linear, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Alkylbenzene, linear, at plant
The functional unit represents 1 kg of liquid linear alkylbenzene. Data are based on the ECOSOL study of the European surfactant industry.;
UUID: 19d5b060-bbc6-326f-bed5-93515ecc1ba7
This module contains material and energy input and production of waste for the production of linear alkylbenzene out of paraffin and benzene. Water consumption, emissions and infrastructure have been estimated.
Location: Data based on the European LAB production
Technology: Average technology, typical for European production conditions in the mid 90s
Time period: date of published literature
Production volume: worldwide production: 2.4 kt
Sampling: Process emissions based on estimations. 
Extrapolations: material and energy data out of ECOSOL study of European Surfactant Industry. Common translation rules used, reported in Chemical report (Althaus et al. 2003).
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_19d5b060-bbc6-326f-bed5-93515ecc1ba7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
